          "normalized_latex": "E[\\phi,W]=-\\mu mg e^{-2\\mu\theta(W)}\\int_{x_0}^{W}(1-2\\phi F)e^{2\\mu\theta(t)}dt+e^{-2\\mu(\theta(W)-\theta(x_0))}E_0[\\phi]",
          "purpose": "Define final energy as the design objective.",
